(364171, 29740, 7151, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t the idea to use a larger bill, like a 20 or 100, to show your affluence?  Anyway, sadly, it works for a trend (I sure hope that power''s a prop).  I think that, given the "cocain" is supposed to be the trend, the focus would be better on it, or at least with a wider DOF.  The bill is definitely very sharp and crisp.  Lighting and composition are great.  Good job.</td>', 'Wasn''t the idea to use a larger bill, like a 20 or 100, to show your affluence?  Anyway, sadly, it works for a trend (I sure hope that power''s a prop).  I think that, given the "cocain" is supposed to be the trend, the focus would be better on it, or at least with a wider DOF.  The bill is definitely very sharp and crisp.  Lighting and composition are great.  Good job.', '2003-07-23 02:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(364172, 29973, 7151, '<td valign="top">I tried this for "Round".  You did a little better than I was able to.  One tip on lessening or eliminating those jaggies at the edge of the lamp:  try resizing in steps.  Instead of going straight from the full image down to 640x480 (or whatever), resize at about 10% increments.  It works great most times.</td>', 'I tried this for "Round".  You did a little better than I was able to.  One tip on lessening or eliminating those jaggies at the edge of the lamp:  try resizing in steps.  Instead of going straight from the full image down to 640x480 (or whatever), resize at about 10% increments.  It works great most times.', '2003-07-23 02:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(364174, 30029, 9602, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if someone was wearing the jeans.</td>', 'Would have been better if someone was wearing the jeans.', '2003-07-23 02:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
