(364561, 29968, 10167, '<td valign="top">Good idea...  My eye goes straight to whatever is reflecting in the background between the left and middle lamps though.  I think the idea would have stood out more if there was no background distraction.</td>', 'Good idea...  My eye goes straight to whatever is reflecting in the background between the left and middle lamps though.  I think the idea would have stood out more if there was no background distraction.', '2003-07-23 09:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(364562, 29740, 8009, '<td valign="top">Great light and composition. Really tells a story. =9</td>', 'Great light and composition. Really tells a story. =9', '2003-07-23 09:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(364563, 29312, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing: though I find this selective desaturation technique a touch obvious now, and often used to make a dull photo more intersting. This does have a remoteness and desertedness that appeals though - and the over-exposure is well done. It''s like a strange dream scene. No idea what to score it though ... :-)</td>', 'Intriguing: though I find this selective desaturation technique a touch obvious now, and often used to make a dull photo more intersting. This does have a remoteness and desertedness that appeals though - and the over-exposure is well done. It''s like a strange dream scene. No idea what to score it though ... :-)', '2003-07-23 09:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(364565, 30080, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good illustration - think I''d like to see more texture in the stonework though.</td>', 'Good illustration - think I''d like to see more texture in the stonework though.', '2003-07-23 09:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(364567, 29313, 6999, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting: the reflections of the flash are horrrible, and I think the white balance has become confused - see how orange the white floor tiles are. Nice enough subject, but it needs natural light to stop it flattening out like this.</td>', 'Poor lighting: the reflections of the flash are horrrible, and I think the white balance has become confused - see how orange the white floor tiles are. Nice enough subject, but it needs natural light to stop it flattening out like this.', '2003-07-23 09:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(364569, 30087, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''d be intersted to know why this shot was submitted: the only good point that I can see is in the relative positions f the two figures: the motion blur, focus, colour depth, exposure are all pretty bad though, and I can''t see a good reason for it being there.</td>', 'I''d be intersted to know why this shot was submitted: the only good point that I can see is in the relative positions f the two figures: the motion blur, focus, colour depth, exposure are all pretty bad though, and I can''t see a good reason for it being there.', '2003-07-23 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(364570, 29375, 6999, '<td valign="top">Taken through glass? If you get closer to the window the dirt on the glass becomes less of an issue. Either that, or of course your lens is filthy! Quite a bit of jpeg noise, and not sure how the image fits the challenge. I expect a bunch of the Americans will find it deliberately offensive - I also expect that was the point. Trends?</td>', 'Taken through glass? If you get closer to the window the dirt on the glass becomes less of an issue. Either that, or of course your lens is filthy! Quite a bit of jpeg noise, and not sure how the image fits the challenge. I expect a bunch of the Americans will find it deliberately offensive - I also expect that was the point. Trends?', '2003-07-23 09:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(364572, 29811, 10222, '<td valign="top">U''ve chosen a very good angle 4 this image. It looks good.</td>', 'U''ve chosen a very good angle 4 this image. It looks good.', '2003-07-23 09:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(364573, 29930, 6999, '<td valign="top">Why have the horse dead centre frame? I would think you could crop to the pillar beside it''s head, and almost up to it''s hooves and lose none of the important information and at the same time increase the compositional impact. It''s a really nice capture though, great moment. levels and contrast could perhaps be usefully played with too.</td>', 'Why have the horse dead centre frame? I would think you could crop to the pillar beside it''s head, and almost up to it''s hooves and lose none of the important information and at the same time increase the compositional impact. It''s a really nice capture though, great moment. levels and contrast could perhaps be usefully played with too.', '2003-07-23 09:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(364575, 29438, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and approach. Think I''d have shot from a little further away and zoomed in or cropped to avoid the distortion of the ''t''. Not sure how it could be changed, but it seems a quite dirty photo, though I guess that''s to do with the reflection and the window.</td>', 'Neat idea, and approach. Think I''d have shot from a little further away and zoomed in or cropped to avoid the distortion of the ''t''. Not sure how it could be changed, but it seems a quite dirty photo, though I guess that''s to do with the reflection and the window.', '2003-07-23 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(364576, 29489, 10222, '<td valign="top">Good thinking</td>', 'Good thinking', '2003-07-23 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(364578, 30091, 6999, '<td valign="top">The moving coins are weird - almost unnoticeable, and i can''t see the point of them. Technically a very good photo, absolutely no problems there, but I can''t really see it''s relevance to the challenge - did people never have money bags before? Is it dated somehow and I just don''t know that?</td>', 'The moving coins are weird - almost unnoticeable, and i can''t see the point of them. Technically a very good photo, absolutely no problems there, but I can''t really see it''s relevance to the challenge - did people never have money bags before? Is it dated somehow and I just don''t know that?', '2003-07-23 09:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(364579, 29503, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) Nice shot too - and nice comment about previous challenges.I always find shots purely of fireworks pretty dull though - I think they need some context.</td>', ':-) Nice shot too - and nice comment about previous challenges.I always find shots purely of fireworks pretty dull though - I think they need some context.', '2003-07-23 09:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(364580, 29896, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''d love it to be the case that these all store the same amount of data. Nice stock photo, though perhaps a litle less square-on to the camera would give more interest: would quite like to see a perspective shot where they all take the same space in the frame, but are obviously receding into the distance.</td>', 'I''d love it to be the case that these all store the same amount of data. Nice stock photo, though perhaps a litle less square-on to the camera would give more interest: would quite like to see a perspective shot where they all take the same space in the frame, but are obviously receding into the distance.', '2003-07-23 09:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(364582, 30008, 6999, '<td valign="top">The flash shadow is annoying - though it has the intriguing effect of flattening out the shot.</td>', 'The flash shadow is annoying - though it has the intriguing effect of flattening out the shot.', '2003-07-23 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(364584, 29867, 5964, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept. The focus is a bit off or it is a lower end cam. I would have kept more to the windows and croped out the buildings.4.</td>', 'Not a bad concept. The focus is a bit off or it is a lower end cam. I would have kept more to the windows and croped out the buildings.4.', '2003-07-23 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(364585, 29310, 6999, '<td valign="top">Flash lighting is really killing this - flattens out all the textures, leaves almost no shadow to give a sense of depth, and fades out nastily into the corners of the room: I''m also quite surprised you were allowed t use it in Arlington House. Would LOVE to see this with the natural light fro that window - could look amazing.</td>', 'Flash lighting is really killing this - flattens out all the textures, leaves almost no shadow to give a sense of depth, and fades out nastily into the corners of the room: I''m also quite surprised you were allowed t use it in Arlington House. Would LOVE to see this with the natural light fro that window - could look amazing.', '2003-07-23 09:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(364588, 30053, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this. Shame it had to be so far over-sharpened - the white around the lettering is quite annoying.</td>', 'I like this. Shame it had to be so far over-sharpened - the white around the lettering is quite annoying.', '2003-07-23 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(364591, 29997, 8860, '<td valign="top">I quite like the disembodied nature of the shot. I wonder if it would have looked even more striking if you''d cropped the top and bottom of the lamp so that you''re left with just the lava with black either side?</td>', 'I quite like the disembodied nature of the shot. I wonder if it would have looked even more striking if you''d cropped the top and bottom of the lamp so that you''re left with just the lava with black either side?', '2003-07-23 09:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(364595, 30022, 8860, '<td valign="top">Given the ridiculous ''fashion'' items featured her I reckon you could have hammed up your pose even more. An attempt at a more interesting composition could have helped too (subject jumping, off-centre, sea view?)</td>', 'Given the ridiculous ''fashion'' items featured her I reckon you could have hammed up your pose even more. An attempt at a more interesting composition could have helped too (subject jumping, off-centre, sea view?)', '2003-07-23 09:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(364597, 29735, 8860, '<td valign="top">More a necessity than a trend (at least I hope it''s not a trend as I use MemSticks!). Nice shot, although the border is pointless against such a light background.</td>', 'More a necessity than a trend (at least I hope it''s not a trend as I use MemSticks!). Nice shot, although the border is pointless against such a light background.', '2003-07-23 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(364599, 29202, 8488, '<td valign="top">You do realize she''s not sewing, she''s spinning, right? Specifically, making yarn/thread from raw fiber.<br/> <br/>Sorry. Fiber artist. :-&gt; For the image itself ... it''s kind of grainy and not all that well-focused, but I''m betting that''s a camera limitation from the ambient lighting condition (since it''s exactly what MINE does in those settings!).</td>', 'You do realize she''s not sewing, she''s spinning, right? Specifically, making yarn/thread from raw fiber. Sorry. Fiber artist. :-> For the image itself ... it''s kind of grainy and not all that well-focused, but I''m betting that''s a camera limitation from the ambient lighting condition (since it''s exactly what MINE does in those settings!).', '2003-07-23 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
