(365141, 29650, 7857, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea to include som many different elements as opposed to just the one, though a more colourful BG may have been a good idea. With so much silver in there the grey gives it a bit of a sterile feel... something more upbeat - a red to match the LP, or perhaps blue could look good here. Very nice idea, good luck with it.</td>', 'It''s a good idea to include som many different elements as opposed to just the one, though a more colourful BG may have been a good idea. With so much silver in there the grey gives it a bit of a sterile feel... something more upbeat - a red to match the LP, or perhaps blue could look good here. Very nice idea, good luck with it.', '2003-07-23 17:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
