(365299, 30075, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the repetiveness here.  Tones are good, but the blown out middle rifle really kills the shot, so to speak.  Also, the edges are really jagged, which tells me the image is oversharpened.  I also hope that the right to bear arms is just a trend.  But I''ll keep my views on the subject out of the voting.</td>', 'I like the repetiveness here.  Tones are good, but the blown out middle rifle really kills the shot, so to speak.  Also, the edges are really jagged, which tells me the image is oversharpened.  I also hope that the right to bear arms is just a trend.  But I''ll keep my views on the subject out of the voting.', '2003-07-23 20:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(365300, 30111, 772, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the greatest ''trends'' photo i have seen this week, but it''s the greates photo in general that i have seen this week... great work... = 10<br/> <br/>I take that back... overeating and laziness are a great trend concept... phenomenal photo :)</td>', 'This isn''t the greatest ''trends'' photo i have seen this week, but it''s the greates photo in general that i have seen this week... great work... = 10 I take that back... overeating and laziness are a great trend concept... phenomenal photo :)', '2003-07-23 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(365303, 29652, 2152, '<td valign="top">This is certaily a nice shot with excellent tones.  The problem I''m having is with this shot meeting the challenge.  Is jazz a trend?  Sure, why not.  Are jazz bars a trend?  Certainly.  But the only obvious connection to jazz in the photo is the trombone case-shaped sign.  And without the title, I probably would not have even noticed the sign.  A bit of a stretch, I think, but I still like the shot.</td>', 'This is certaily a nice shot with excellent tones.  The problem I''m having is with this shot meeting the challenge.  Is jazz a trend?  Sure, why not.  Are jazz bars a trend?  Certainly.  But the only obvious connection to jazz in the photo is the trombone case-shaped sign.  And without the title, I probably would not have even noticed the sign.  A bit of a stretch, I think, but I still like the shot.', '2003-07-23 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(365310, 29496, 255, '<td valign="top">this is awesome. great lighting, composition--love the framing. great work!</td>', 'this is awesome. great lighting, composition--love the framing. great work!', '2003-07-23 20:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(365313, 29867, 7570, '<td valign="top">it might have been better if this shot is taken symetrically. The angle used coupled with the cropping is not to my liking. Maybe you should have tried standing straight-on and took a shot. 6</td>', 'it might have been better if this shot is taken symetrically. The angle used coupled with the cropping is not to my liking. Maybe you should have tried standing straight-on and took a shot. 6', '2003-07-23 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(365319, 30103, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think you went a little overboard with the tones.  Contrast is good, but the pose seems a little unnatural.</td>', 'I think you went a little overboard with the tones.  Contrast is good, but the pose seems a little unnatural.', '2003-07-23 20:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(365323, 29740, 10111, '<td valign="top">I like it, and this is truley nit picking... the "coke" should have been a little less, and "cut" iinto a straight line....    it just looks like there is a bit too much to be belivable.</td>', 'I like it, and this is truley nit picking... the "coke" should have been a little less, and "cut" iinto a straight line....    it just looks like there is a bit too much to be belivable.', '2003-07-23 20:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(365324, 30111, 9287, '<td valign="top">funny, good idea :)</td>', 'funny, good idea :)', '2003-07-23 20:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(365326, 29202, 2152, '<td valign="top">This is great - the old look, the muted colors - I like this a lot.  I don''t really think of sewing as a trend, but the way you present it here with the old equipment strengthens the connection.  Something probably should have been done about the window and the background, even if you were going for that candid look.</td>', 'This is great - the old look, the muted colors - I like this a lot.  I don''t really think of sewing as a trend, but the way you present it here with the old equipment strengthens the connection.  Something probably should have been done about the window and the background, even if you were going for that candid look.', '2003-07-23 20:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(365328, 29222, 2152, '<td valign="top">Aren''t these things colorful?  If so, then why is this shot in black and white?  Doesn''t make sense to me...</td>', 'Aren''t these things colorful?  If so, then why is this shot in black and white?  Doesn''t make sense to me...', '2003-07-23 20:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(365331, 30074, 9287, '<td valign="top">haha, love these things :) nice one</td>', 'haha, love these things :) nice one', '2003-07-23 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(365334, 30080, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the tones are good.  I think it''s lacking a little contrast, however.</td>', 'I like the composition and the tones are good.  I think it''s lacking a little contrast, however.', '2003-07-23 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(365335, 29979, 9809, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and great balance.</td>', 'Nice colors and great balance.', '2003-07-23 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(365339, 29988, 2152, '<td valign="top">That much tone is completely unnecessary.  I''m not sure why you did that, but I do not like it at all.  The guy on the right should get lost.</td>', 'That much tone is completely unnecessary.  I''m not sure why you did that, but I do not like it at all.  The guy on the right should get lost.', '2003-07-23 20:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(365343, 30108, 9809, '<td valign="top">I like the shot -- well conceived and well executed, but why the red hue? I guess with anti-forgery protection built-in, there isn''t much you can do about the moire in the 100''s and in Ben''s background.</td>', 'I like the shot -- well conceived and well executed, but why the red hue? I guess with anti-forgery protection built-in, there isn''t much you can do about the moire in the 100''s and in Ben''s background.', '2003-07-23 20:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(365348, 30072, 2152, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I see the soft focus and lightness you''re going for, but I think it''s way too much in this case.  You can hardly see the baby or if the baby is being fed, one of which which, according to the title, should be the subject of the photograph.  All I see is a woman holding what appears to be a baby''s head.  And I don''t think it''s a trend.</td>', 'Yeah, I see the soft focus and lightness you''re going for, but I think it''s way too much in this case.  You can hardly see the baby or if the baby is being fed, one of which which, according to the title, should be the subject of the photograph.  All I see is a woman holding what appears to be a baby''s head.  And I don''t think it''s a trend.', '2003-07-23 20:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
