(365546, 29795, 2152, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and dof.  I like how the string hangs diagonally across the frame instead of straitght down.  Don''t really like the blown out sky, especially because there are some darker areas on the upper right.</td>', 'Nice composition and dof.  I like how the string hangs diagonally across the frame instead of straitght down.  Don''t really like the blown out sky, especially because there are some darker areas on the upper right.', '2003-07-23 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(365549, 30046, 2152, '<td valign="top">Good composition and focus.  I like the colors coming out of the wire along with the contrast against the background.  Certainly a current trend.  Not the most photogenic subject, but you did well to make it look interesting.</td>', 'Good composition and focus.  I like the colors coming out of the wire along with the contrast against the background.  Certainly a current trend.  Not the most photogenic subject, but you did well to make it look interesting.', '2003-07-23 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(365553, 30004, 2152, '<td valign="top">Consider a lower angle on the subject - possibly one that would allow you to balance the bottom of the frame with the reflections.  Image quality is low, but I''m not sure about the limitations of your camera.  The image is 1/10 the size that is allowed on this site, which doesn''t help.</td>', 'Consider a lower angle on the subject - possibly one that would allow you to balance the bottom of the frame with the reflections.  Image quality is low, but I''m not sure about the limitations of your camera.  The image is 1/10 the size that is allowed on this site, which doesn''t help.', '2003-07-23 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
