(365660, 29996, 8865, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture. But I find it a little to bright up top, and to dark below. Would have been nice to see her tattoo''s, and necklaces a bit better. Her necklaces seem to dark for the most part, and her tattoo''s seem a bit covered up. But it''s all good =)</td>', 'It''s a good picture. But I find it a little to bright up top, and to dark below. Would have been nice to see her tattoo''s, and necklaces a bit better. Her necklaces seem to dark for the most part, and her tattoo''s seem a bit covered up. But it''s all good =)', '2003-07-24 01:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
