(366358, 30055, 6888, '<td valign="top">interesting effect you have created here, almost a surreal 3D type effect that most DPCers wont get</td>', 'interesting effect you have created here, almost a surreal 3D type effect that most DPCers wont get', '2003-07-24 22:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(366360, 29874, 2792, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  Great model!  Like the different fonts.  IMHO, I would have used more colors (in the fonts) to make this image pop out even more or having fashion magazine covers taped to her.  =-p  . Not especially fond of seeing the backdrop, it somewhat distracts.  The position of the arms makes me feel like she is surrendering to the "trends" or throwing her arms up in protest, I''m not sure which.  Perhaps seeing her hands or having a different look in her eye would reveal a bit more of her statement. Would also like to have seen what it said on her right shoulder.  =-)  Still, a great job and one of my favs in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this one!  Great model!  Like the different fonts.  IMHO, I would have used more colors (in the fonts) to make this image pop out even more or having fashion magazine covers taped to her.  =-p  . Not especially fond of seeing the backdrop, it somewhat distracts.  The position of the arms makes me feel like she is surrendering to the "trends" or throwing her arms up in protest, I''m not sure which.  Perhaps seeing her hands or having a different look in her eye would reveal a bit more of her statement. Would also like to have seen what it said on her right shoulder.  =-)  Still, a great job and one of my favs in the challenge.', '2003-07-24 22:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(366367, 30013, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think you should have used more of the available file size.  This shot is 400x400 and the max id 640x640.  I like the block-like effect in this photograph.  But with the lighting and dark subjects (especially the hi-8 and vhs) it''s hard to differentiate between them.  Also, I''m wondering why you chose the border you did.  It looks more like the photo is cut off than an actual border - especially at the top.</td>', 'I think you should have used more of the available file size.  This shot is 400x400 and the max id 640x640.  I like the block-like effect in this photograph.  But with the lighting and dark subjects (especially the hi-8 and vhs) it''s hard to differentiate between them.  Also, I''m wondering why you chose the border you did.  It looks more like the photo is cut off than an actual border - especially at the top.', '2003-07-24 23:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(366382, 29619, 8722, '<td valign="top">This photo is quite nice, I like it alot - 8</td>', 'This photo is quite nice, I like it alot - 8', '2003-07-24 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(366384, 30052, 2152, '<td valign="top">This photo seems flat to me.  It looks like there''s potential for good tones, but it lacks the contrast that would bring those tones out since they are all located in the same area of the histogram.  Try adjusting the levels in your image editing program.  I took it into photoshop and a few small adjustments made a huge difference, to me, at least.<br/> <br/>I can hardly see the border, so it was probably unnecessary.</td>', 'This photo seems flat to me.  It looks like there''s potential for good tones, but it lacks the contrast that would bring those tones out since they are all located in the same area of the histogram.  Try adjusting the levels in your image editing program.  I took it into photoshop and a few small adjustments made a huge difference, to me, at least. I can hardly see the border, so it was probably unnecessary.', '2003-07-24 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(366388, 29323, 3735, '<td valign="top">I dont understand the trend but it is a great photo 10</td>', 'I dont understand the trend but it is a great photo 10', '2003-07-25 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(366392, 30091, 9893, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better if they strap were leading around the picture-plane, rather than off of it.</td>', 'I think I would like this better if they strap were leading around the picture-plane, rather than off of it.', '2003-07-25 00:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(366395, 29203, 2612, '<td valign="top">It is a nice bold photo of a tatoo being in progress, but it appears slightly out of focus. The composition is good with the diagonol likes of the arm and fingers making a dynamic image.</td>', 'It is a nice bold photo of a tatoo being in progress, but it appears slightly out of focus. The composition is good with the diagonol likes of the arm and fingers making a dynamic image.', '2003-07-25 00:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(366399, 29690, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like the golden highlights and the striking blue background. The lines in the tower on the left are not verticle, which I think is fairly important in a picture of this nature. You probably could not get all of the lines verticle without perspective control, but I think the strong lines on the left would be the ones to focus on. Still a good image.</td>', 'I like the golden highlights and the striking blue background. The lines in the tower on the left are not verticle, which I think is fairly important in a picture of this nature. You probably could not get all of the lines verticle without perspective control, but I think the strong lines on the left would be the ones to focus on. Still a good image.', '2003-07-25 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(366407, 29496, 7800, '<td valign="top">Love this. Great grungy color and awesome placement in frame. 9</td>', 'Love this. Great grungy color and awesome placement in frame. 9', '2003-07-25 00:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
