(366542, 29646, 4008, '<td valign="top">Although I feel I see too many American flags in challenges (no disrespect), that at the same time confirms patriotism is a trend. I think your picture is exceptionally well done. The composition, the fine detail, the placement of the ribbon, the low light, the shadows, depth of field. Can''t think of anything to improve. 10 points from me.</td>', 'Although I feel I see too many American flags in challenges (no disrespect), that at the same time confirms patriotism is a trend. I think your picture is exceptionally well done. The composition, the fine detail, the placement of the ribbon, the low light, the shadows, depth of field. Can''t think of anything to improve. 10 points from me.', '2003-07-25 07:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(366558, 29438, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - good feeling of depth and contrast. Nice urban vibe and appealing colours. Top job showing current, contemporary movement in todays society. [10]</td>', 'Excellent shot - good feeling of depth and contrast. Nice urban vibe and appealing colours. Top job showing current, contemporary movement in todays society. [10]', '2003-07-25 08:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
