(366976, 29646, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not really moved much by American patriotism, which is to be expected, given that I''m not American... but I do think this image is nicely done - an unusual close focus rather than showing most of a flag waving in the breeze - and the curve of the ribbon really gives a great focal point.</td>', 'I''m not really moved much by American patriotism, which is to be expected, given that I''m not American... but I do think this image is nicely done - an unusual close focus rather than showing most of a flag waving in the breeze - and the curve of the ribbon really gives a great focal point.', '2003-07-25 17:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(366978, 29874, 3087, '<td valign="top">An image that really made me stop and look. I am not sure I like the image for itself - I don''t know that it works well outside of the challenge - but certainly an interesting concept.</td>', 'An image that really made me stop and look. I am not sure I like the image for itself - I don''t know that it works well outside of the challenge - but certainly an interesting concept.', '2003-07-25 17:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(366979, 30008, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh noooo, don''t throw him awaaaay.... I had to hide the screen from my own one - he sits on my desk just near my monitor... poor thing...<br/>Great pic and angle but framing is poor - ie positioning of bin/ trash within frame.</td>', 'Oh noooo, don''t throw him awaaaay.... I had to hide the screen from my own one - he sits on my desk just near my monitor... poor thing...Great pic and angle but framing is poor - ie positioning of bin/ trash within frame.', '2003-07-25 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(366982, 29323, 3087, '<td valign="top">Eeuw - yes - even worse than pebble dashing!</td>', 'Eeuw - yes - even worse than pebble dashing!', '2003-07-25 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(366984, 29617, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit - what a striking portrait.</td>', 'Beautifully lit - what a striking portrait.', '2003-07-25 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(366990, 29247, 2152, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s going on here, but if there are at least seven women doing it (wearing it?), it must be some sort of trend. ;)  Colors and composition are great.  But I think the focus could be a little sharper and it seems a little underexposed.</td>', 'Not sure what''s going on here, but if there are at least seven women doing it (wearing it?), it must be some sort of trend. ;)  Colors and composition are great.  But I think the focus could be a little sharper and it seems a little underexposed.', '2003-07-25 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(366991, 29873, 2152, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the way the slinky is framed.  However, it seems to me that the focus should be on the brighter areas on the right rather than the upper left.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the way the slinky is framed.  However, it seems to me that the focus should be on the brighter areas on the right rather than the upper left.', '2003-07-25 18:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(366995, 29919, 2152, '<td valign="top">The addition of the IV makes what would have been a boring shot a lot more interesting.  I think some care could have been taken to clean up the order of the fries a bit.  As for the sandwich... never seen one of those at McD''s, but that doesn''t really matter to me.</td>', 'The addition of the IV makes what would have been a boring shot a lot more interesting.  I think some care could have been taken to clean up the order of the fries a bit.  As for the sandwich... never seen one of those at McD''s, but that doesn''t really matter to me.', '2003-07-25 18:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(367006, 29896, 10584, '<td valign="top">Creative thought! Picture exhibits some symmetry</td>', 'Creative thought! Picture exhibits some symmetry', '2003-07-25 18:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(367031, 29656, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The different colors, textures, and patterns work well together. And good exposure; you can make out details in both the light and dark areas. It would have been even better if the right side was in better focus.</td>', 'Nice composition. The different colors, textures, and patterns work well together. And good exposure; you can make out details in both the light and dark areas. It would have been even better if the right side was in better focus.', '2003-07-25 19:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(367034, 29921, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I like the way she is posed. The lighting is perhaps a bit strong, but I like the angle. Cutting off the top of someone''s head is a tricky compositional choice, but I think it works here to help balance the image, keeping it from being bottom-heavy.</td>', 'Great portrait. I like the way she is posed. The lighting is perhaps a bit strong, but I like the angle. Cutting off the top of someone''s head is a tricky compositional choice, but I think it works here to help balance the image, keeping it from being bottom-heavy.', '2003-07-25 19:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(367039, 29650, 10402, '<td valign="top">The trends images here aren''t from a single decate, but it was fun anyway. Your technique is outstanding; capturing such a wide range of values from very black to very white is difficult. I like the spash of color from the CDR on the left. Did you have to do anything special to get the images in the negative strip to show?</td>', 'The trends images here aren''t from a single decate, but it was fun anyway. Your technique is outstanding; capturing such a wide range of values from very black to very white is difficult. I like the spash of color from the CDR on the left. Did you have to do anything special to get the images in the negative strip to show?', '2003-07-25 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(367040, 29408, 10402, '<td valign="top">The sun shining through the flag is a nice touch that keeps this from being just another flag photo.</td>', 'The sun shining through the flag is a nice touch that keeps this from being just another flag photo.', '2003-07-25 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(367042, 30111, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice control over the depth of field here. The background is a bit distracting, but its soft focus helps direct the viewer''s attention back to the subjects.</td>', 'Nice control over the depth of field here. The background is a bit distracting, but its soft focus helps direct the viewer''s attention back to the subjects.', '2003-07-25 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367043, 30099, 10402, '<td valign="top">Photographing flowers does seem to be trendy. The high contrast on this one gives it an appearance suggestive of a chinese painting (where flowers have always been a favorite subject). I like it.</td>', 'Photographing flowers does seem to be trendy. The high contrast on this one gives it an appearance suggestive of a chinese painting (where flowers have always been a favorite subject). I like it.', '2003-07-25 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(367044, 30023, 10402, '<td valign="top">You''re right; it is bigger than mine. But that''s OK; I prefer the smaller ones; they''re easier to pet. The clouds add interest to this image without unduly distracting from the subject. The strong side lighting brings out the texture of the rock, but also casts a shadow that hides part of the rock. If I were photographing my pet rock I''d just turn it a bit to get the lighting right! But your''s is probably too big.</td>', 'You''re right; it is bigger than mine. But that''s OK; I prefer the smaller ones; they''re easier to pet. The clouds add interest to this image without unduly distracting from the subject. The strong side lighting brings out the texture of the rock, but also casts a shadow that hides part of the rock. If I were photographing my pet rock I''d just turn it a bit to get the lighting right! But your''s is probably too big.', '2003-07-25 20:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(367049, 29801, 8722, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, and true. Converse especially hi-tops, will always be a trend. And I like the simplicity in the photo too. Just......the trend.</td>', 'Nice photo, and true. Converse especially hi-tops, will always be a trend. And I like the simplicity in the photo too. Just......the trend.', '2003-07-25 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367050, 29973, 8722, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-07-25 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(367051, 29996, 8722, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white on this one. Its good, keep it up.</td>', 'I like the black and white on this one. Its good, keep it up.', '2003-07-25 20:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(367053, 29919, 8722, '<td valign="top">This i pretty humourous! I like it, and creative. Fits right in to the McDonald trend! Good job - 9</td>', 'This i pretty humourous! I like it, and creative. Fits right in to the McDonald trend! Good job - 9', '2003-07-25 20:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(367055, 29740, 8722, '<td valign="top">This is....trendy for some people. I like how you got it when someone was sniffing...or blowing, one or the other. Its good. - 8</td>', 'This is....trendy for some people. I like how you got it when someone was sniffing...or blowing, one or the other. Its good. - 8', '2003-07-25 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(367056, 29997, 8722, '<td valign="top">Nice. Trendy since the late 80''s.</td>', 'Nice. Trendy since the late 80''s.', '2003-07-25 20:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(367058, 30093, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. The soft focus on the back of the ring shows what it is without distracting from the \"mood\" part. The light (and seemingly doubled) reflection adds interest. And it is surrounded by just the right amount of white space.</td>', 'I like your composition. The soft focus on the back of the ring shows what it is without distracting from the \"mood\" part. The light (and seemingly doubled) reflection adds interest. And it is surrounded by just the right amount of white space.', '2003-07-25 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(367059, 29565, 7706, '<td valign="top">oh wow  this is a cool shot.</td>', 'oh wow  this is a cool shot.', '2003-07-25 20:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(367061, 29992, 8722, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion. Clever idea. I really like this alot! Amazing. - 10</td>', 'Very nice compostion. Clever idea. I really like this alot! Amazing. - 10', '2003-07-25 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(367063, 29222, 8722, '<td valign="top">Ah yes. The memorable pogs. Hours of fun, and hours of frustration. But yet, a great trend. - 7</td>', 'Ah yes. The memorable pogs. Hours of fun, and hours of frustration. But yet, a great trend. - 7', '2003-07-25 20:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(367065, 29896, 8722, '<td valign="top">Nice. A little decension from techological time. - 7</td>', 'Nice. A little decension from techological time. - 7', '2003-07-25 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(367067, 29477, 8722, '<td valign="top">Was this taken on a cruise boat? When I was on one, I had a light switch just like that, and it appears to be in the same place as it was on the boat.</td>', 'Was this taken on a cruise boat? When I was on one, I had a light switch just like that, and it appears to be in the same place as it was on the boat.', '2003-07-25 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(367071, 30055, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color. The well-controlled motion blur makes the image more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice use of color. The well-controlled motion blur makes the image more dynamic.', '2003-07-25 20:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(367072, 29919, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Nice setup, and the lighting is just right.</td>', 'Very creative. Nice setup, and the lighting is just right.', '2003-07-25 20:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(367075, 30072, 10402, '<td valign="top">The high key exposure and soft focus are appropriate for this photograph. The exposure of the face is great; you can still make out the nose and cheeks. But the bottom part of the image is too over-exposed; you can''t make out the mother''s fingers and the baby''s hair is washed out.</td>', 'The high key exposure and soft focus are appropriate for this photograph. The exposure of the face is great; you can still make out the nose and cheeks. But the bottom part of the image is too over-exposed; you can''t make out the mother''s fingers and the baby''s hair is washed out.', '2003-07-25 21:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(367082, 29867, 8367, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. I think it might look even better straight on. ( I usually shoot at an angle to add depth. But, in this case with everything left and right being equal, I think it should be shot straight at it.) Love the wings! Would love to see a close up..</td>', 'I like your composition. I think it might look even better straight on. ( I usually shoot at an angle to add depth. But, in this case with everything left and right being equal, I think it should be shot straight at it.) Love the wings! Would love to see a close up..', '2003-07-25 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(367091, 30101, 8610, '<td valign="top">Love it... trend or not - 9</td>', 'Love it... trend or not - 9', '2003-07-25 22:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(367177, 29794, 2110, '<td valign="top">very gooda ttempt for your first photograph on DPchallange!!<br/>The composition and view angle is nice, the white in the phone is overpowering and detail is lost due to increased contrast, the background blue could have beena  gray.<br/>Overall a good photograph!</td>', 'very gooda ttempt for your first photograph on DPchallange!!The composition and view angle is nice, the white in the phone is overpowering and detail is lost due to increased contrast, the background blue could have beena  gray.Overall a good photograph!', '2003-07-26 02:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(367178, 30016, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice b/w shot. I really like the graphic nature of this. the cropping is a bit strange, but all in all good job. :o)</td>', 'nice b/w shot. I really like the graphic nature of this. the cropping is a bit strange, but all in all good job. :o)', '2003-07-26 03:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
