(367430, 29794, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks like you used the flash here. Using lamps to light the phone etc could mean you dont need the flash and you avoid the harsh shadows. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot, looks like you used the flash here. Using lamps to light the phone etc could mean you dont need the flash and you avoid the harsh shadows. Good luck with it.', '2003-07-26 16:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(367452, 30103, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice colour choice for the tint. I can''t make out the lace.<br/>Composition doesn''t work so well for me - too close to edge of frame at top and not far off centre enough to work as a non-centred composition, for me.<br/>Man, you got nice legs...</td>', 'Nice shot and nice colour choice for the tint. I can''t make out the lace.Composition doesn''t work so well for me - too close to edge of frame at top and not far off centre enough to work as a non-centred composition, for me.Man, you got nice legs...', '2003-07-26 18:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(367462, 29334, 7778, '<td valign="top">An connoisseur would consider cubism a ''movement'' rather than a ''trend''. The clock in this capture is certainly ''trendy'', although not purely ''cubist''. <br/> <br/>As a photo, the approach here is straigthforward enough. Outside and beyond the challenge, I doubt it can support a life on its own.</td>', 'An connoisseur would consider cubism a ''movement'' rather than a ''trend''. The clock in this capture is certainly ''trendy'', although not purely ''cubist''.  As a photo, the approach here is straigthforward enough. Outside and beyond the challenge, I doubt it can support a life on its own.', '2003-07-26 18:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
