(367746, 30100, 1644, '<td valign="top">Yep, that about covers it! I think a different background color would have given this image more impact. Personally I think the green blends too much. But I like your idea.</td>', 'Yep, that about covers it! I think a different background color would have given this image more impact. Personally I think the green blends too much. But I like your idea.', '2003-07-27 13:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
