(367863, 30094, 10626, '<td valign="top">Very good composition</td>', 'Very good composition', '2003-07-27 17:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(367871, 30074, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice study. Image is a little noisy and slightly unsharp, so reducing size would help a little. When you''re filling the frame like this the quality of the shot becomes more relevant. I would have cropped tighter too. [6]</td>', 'Nice study. Image is a little noisy and slightly unsharp, so reducing size would help a little. When you''re filling the frame like this the quality of the shot becomes more relevant. I would have cropped tighter too. [6]', '2003-07-27 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(367872, 29792, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image is quite heavily compressed (pixellated). Apart from that I would prefer either a more acute angle (so that you were closer to some of the products) - or a very square face-on view which may present the shades in a more striking way with horizontal lines offerig the feeling of ''infinite'' lines to right and left. [5]</td>', 'Image is quite heavily compressed (pixellated). Apart from that I would prefer either a more acute angle (so that you were closer to some of the products) - or a very square face-on view which may present the shades in a more striking way with horizontal lines offerig the feeling of ''infinite'' lines to right and left. [5]', '2003-07-27 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(367874, 30111, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice snap. A good study of a worrying trend too! I like the space to the left of the shot, but it would have been nice not to crop the back of the bench even if it meant pulling back slightly. [7]</td>', 'Nice snap. A good study of a worrying trend too! I like the space to the left of the shot, but it would have been nice not to crop the back of the bench even if it meant pulling back slightly. [7]', '2003-07-27 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(367877, 30024, 8860, '<td valign="top">This image is quite degraded by compression/resolution. The desaturation makes it look quite nostalgic, so that helps. I definitely think the border is pointless though and does nothing to enhance the subject.</td>', 'This image is quite degraded by compression/resolution. The desaturation makes it look quite nostalgic, so that helps. I definitely think the border is pointless though and does nothing to enhance the subject.', '2003-07-27 18:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(367878, 30020, 8860, '<td valign="top">As far as I''m aware everyone''s always made Barbie topless when possibel whatever the era! A little more focus/DOF on her ''nipples'' may have helped, since they are the main points of the image (excuse the pun!). [6]</td>', 'As far as I''m aware everyone''s always made Barbie topless when possibel whatever the era! A little more focus/DOF on her ''nipples'' may have helped, since they are the main points of the image (excuse the pun!). [6]', '2003-07-27 18:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(367892, 29313, 10628, '<td valign="top">I know about 60''s second hand, but this photograph is my idea of a Coffe Bar. The subject, however colorful, is not harmonic, the checkerboard in the floor doesn''t fit with the psicodelic curves, I think that''s why I don''t like the photo that much.</td>', 'I know about 60''s second hand, but this photograph is my idea of a Coffe Bar. The subject, however colorful, is not harmonic, the checkerboard in the floor doesn''t fit with the psicodelic curves, I think that''s why I don''t like the photo that much.', '2003-07-27 18:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(367897, 30024, 10628, '<td valign="top">Very good subject, but technique in the photo isn''t up to it, I don''t see a reason for the blurr, and I would have used strong red-coke colors, a missed opportunity with such a good frame and subjects.</td>', 'Very good subject, but technique in the photo isn''t up to it, I don''t see a reason for the blurr, and I would have used strong red-coke colors, a missed opportunity with such a good frame and subjects.', '2003-07-27 18:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(367900, 30111, 10045, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a growing trend!!  Great shot!<br/></td>', 'This is definitely a growing trend!!  Great shot!', '2003-07-27 18:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(367901, 29919, 10045, '<td valign="top">This is hysterical!!  Gawd that burger looks disgusting! :-) 9</td>', 'This is hysterical!!  Gawd that burger looks disgusting! :-) 9', '2003-07-27 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(367902, 29874, 10045, '<td valign="top">Is that Dawn French?  Her eyes look just like her! Ha! Ha!</td>', 'Is that Dawn French?  Her eyes look just like her! Ha! Ha!', '2003-07-27 18:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(367903, 29332, 10628, '<td valign="top">I see good balance among the elements of the frame, a special V clouds formation, sharp detail in a fast moving subject, and good support from the browns in the ground.  Nevertheless, I don''t fly hight to another decade, I see some over exposition, and a blue bike and pilot is not what I would have selected for this frame</td>', 'I see good balance among the elements of the frame, a special V clouds formation, sharp detail in a fast moving subject, and good support from the browns in the ground.  Nevertheless, I don''t fly hight to another decade, I see some over exposition, and a blue bike and pilot is not what I would have selected for this frame', '2003-07-27 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(367936, 29646, 10644, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, color, clarity</td>', 'Excellent composition, color, clarity', '2003-07-27 20:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(367939, 30038, 8377, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like the concept and I really like the layering of the jeans.  You have a lot of different colors (shades?) of jeans, which brings even more appeal to the photo.  I also like how the whole photo is jeans, there isnt anything else in the frame.  This picture really has great character.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like the concept and I really like the layering of the jeans.  You have a lot of different colors (shades?) of jeans, which brings even more appeal to the photo.  I also like how the whole photo is jeans, there isnt anything else in the frame.  This picture really has great character.', '2003-07-27 20:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(367942, 29272, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I love how you can see the "star" in convers all star through the shoelace hole.  wonderful focusing.  great color.</td>', 'I love this!  I love how you can see the "star" in convers all star through the shoelace hole.  wonderful focusing.  great color.', '2003-07-27 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1);
