(368367, 29988, 9337, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great picture, and a sweet car for sure. The only drawback for me is the colors chosen for the duotone. There appears to be an overall yellow hue which detracts from the scene.</td>', 'This looks like a great picture, and a sweet car for sure. The only drawback for me is the colors chosen for the duotone. There appears to be an overall yellow hue which detracts from the scene.', '2003-07-28 09:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(368368, 29896, 9337, '<td valign="top">Great concept, everything sure is getting smaller. I really like the colors you got out of the biggest drive. The lighting and background is great. There appears to be a grey cast on in the right from the 3.5" drive up to the corner. Good shot none the less.</td>', 'Great concept, everything sure is getting smaller. I really like the colors you got out of the biggest drive. The lighting and background is great. There appears to be a grey cast on in the right from the 3.5" drive up to the corner. Good shot none the less.', '2003-07-28 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
