(368410, 29272, 4493, '<td valign="top">Enjoy your blue ribbon. This is an excellent study. I like the textures in the shoe in the back and the affective use of the eye hole to focus on the logo. Nice work! 10 -danny</td>', 'Enjoy your blue ribbon. This is an excellent study. I like the textures in the shoe in the back and the affective use of the eye hole to focus on the logo. Nice work! 10 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
