(368414, 29991, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good textures and colors. Youth of today can recognize this logo anywhere. Well done. 8 -danny</td>', 'Good textures and colors. Youth of today can recognize this logo anywhere. Well done. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(368415, 30095, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not a fashionable trend, or one that most people like to participate in, but I like your thinking here. This shows trend nicely. Simple yet affective. 8 -danny</td>', 'Not a fashionable trend, or one that most people like to participate in, but I like your thinking here. This shows trend nicely. Simple yet affective. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(368418, 30086, 4493, '<td valign="top">Yup! Less fat but same great taste! Good lighting and simple affective composition. Amazing that we think that these are healthier... calories are calories :-D 8 -danny</td>', 'Yup! Less fat but same great taste! Good lighting and simple affective composition. Amazing that we think that these are healthier... calories are calories :-D 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(368419, 29896, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good display of how technology shrinks the world. I remember an old 500MB harddrive we had on a server that took two people to lift!. I think keeping the gradient in the background was a good choice. 8 -danny</td>', 'Good display of how technology shrinks the world. I remember an old 500MB harddrive we had on a server that took two people to lift!. I think keeping the gradient in the background was a good choice. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(368423, 30054, 4493, '<td valign="top">Technically there are several things that make this image rough around the edges, but the moment that you captured means more to me then the technical things. I like the drink, cigar, shirt, hat... it all works well together. The location of the shoot with the colors and composition make for a thought provoking image. 8 -danny</td>', 'Technically there are several things that make this image rough around the edges, but the moment that you captured means more to me then the technical things. I like the drink, cigar, shirt, hat... it all works well together. The location of the shoot with the colors and composition make for a thought provoking image. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(368424, 29740, 4493, '<td valign="top">May not be a publically approved image, but I think your tones in this image as well as the simple layout make a powerful statement. A $100 bill would have been nice :-) 8 -danny</td>', 'May not be a publically approved image, but I think your tones in this image as well as the simple layout make a powerful statement. A $100 bill would have been nice :-) 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(368426, 29997, 4493, '<td valign="top">Of all the lava lamp shots this week, I like this one the most. Very clear shot, simple layout and composition. Good colors too! 8 -danny</td>', 'Of all the lava lamp shots this week, I like this one the most. Very clear shot, simple layout and composition. Good colors too! 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(368427, 30093, 4493, '<td valign="top">Pleasant shot. Nice background and good focus on the ring. Sometimes it''s the simple things in life that bring us pleasure. 8 -danny</td>', 'Pleasant shot. Nice background and good focus on the ring. Sometimes it''s the simple things in life that bring us pleasure. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(368428, 29646, 4493, '<td valign="top">Just the flag or just the ribbon would have been a lesser shot, putting the two together makes a great image. This shows how we embrace our heritage and honor those who have fallen to keep us free. 8 -danny</td>', 'Just the flag or just the ribbon would have been a lesser shot, putting the two together makes a great image. This shows how we embrace our heritage and honor those who have fallen to keep us free. 8 -danny', '2003-07-28 10:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
