(369222, 29777, 6870, '<td valign="top">I"m not sure what the trend here is. Freeze-dried pets after they die? Hmmmm. I do like the photo, though. Composition is marvelous. It may use a little more contrast--darker darks, lighter lights? NIce.</td>', 'I"m not sure what the trend here is. Freeze-dried pets after they die? Hmmmm. I do like the photo, though. Composition is marvelous. It may use a little more contrast--darker darks, lighter lights? NIce.', '2003-07-29 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
