(369260, 30055, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this shot.  I''m a big fan of the underlit photos.  I''m afraid there is a little bit of noise in this picture.  Good job though!</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this shot.  I''m a big fan of the underlit photos.  I''m afraid there is a little bit of noise in this picture.  Good job though!', '2003-07-29 03:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
