(369271, 29735, 210, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  I appreciate the fact that you didn''t have a cheesy title and didn''t have everything laid out like it was 3rd grade all over again.  Very nice, clean, well-angled shot.  Having seen about 100, so far, this is hands down my favorite.</td>', 'Love this shot.  I appreciate the fact that you didn''t have a cheesy title and didn''t have everything laid out like it was 3rd grade all over again.  Very nice, clean, well-angled shot.  Having seen about 100, so far, this is hands down my favorite.', '2003-07-29 03:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(369277, 29856, 2591, '<td valign="top">I hope I never see another lava lamp again</td>', 'I hope I never see another lava lamp again', '2003-07-29 03:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(369295, 29740, 10124, '<td valign="top">Very provocative. Congrats on a great shot. I like the muted color and the slight reflection of the coke is great.</td>', 'Very provocative. Congrats on a great shot. I like the muted color and the slight reflection of the coke is great.', '2003-07-29 04:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(369296, 30090, 10124, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition</td>', 'Very nice composition', '2003-07-29 04:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(369297, 29679, 10124, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-07-29 04:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(369300, 30076, 10124, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh. Poorly framed. Iwould not have cut off the feet. Subject matter doesn''t really excite me either. But not a bad effort overall.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh. Poorly framed. Iwould not have cut off the feet. Subject matter doesn''t really excite me either. But not a bad effort overall.', '2003-07-29 04:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(369302, 30099, 10124, '<td valign="top">I think the composition could''ve been better. Tighter crop on the flowers is my suggestion. There''s no real focal point here. Try shooting from a different angle as well to make it more interesting. Rather dull as it stands now.</td>', 'I think the composition could''ve been better. Tighter crop on the flowers is my suggestion. There''s no real focal point here. Try shooting from a different angle as well to make it more interesting. Rather dull as it stands now.', '2003-07-29 04:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(369306, 29931, 10124, '<td valign="top">Needs more dramatic lighting. Too flat as it stands now. Not very well focused. I''m not sensing a focal point here. To many competing elements. I don''t care for the subject matter either, but it could''ve been more interesting had you cropped in tighter on the Furby at a different angle and made more use of shadows and lighting.</td>', 'Needs more dramatic lighting. Too flat as it stands now. Not very well focused. I''m not sensing a focal point here. To many competing elements. I don''t care for the subject matter either, but it could''ve been more interesting had you cropped in tighter on the Furby at a different angle and made more use of shadows and lighting.', '2003-07-29 04:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(369307, 30086, 10124, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting(a little bit flat), vibrant colors look good.</td>', 'Nice lighting(a little bit flat), vibrant colors look good.', '2003-07-29 04:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(369308, 30078, 10124, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting. Could''ve been composed better. Subject matter too cliche(third beanie baby I''ve seen so far) and "cutsie".  I''m left thinking that more effort could''ve gone into this shot.</td>', 'Poor lighting. Could''ve been composed better. Subject matter too cliche(third beanie baby I''ve seen so far) and "cutsie".  I''m left thinking that more effort could''ve gone into this shot.', '2003-07-29 04:37:15.000000', NULL, 1);
