(370142, 30103, 811, '<td valign="top">Sorry i didn''t get around to commenting on this during the challenge.  I did think it was a good photograph, but not the best you have done.  I like the coloring, it really seems to have some zip, and it adds interest.  I think the lace was a little indistinguishable, but the Levis part was good.  The composition seems a touch of balance to me.  It is too far right to be centered, and not enough space on the left to feel like it is on a solid third.  But that may just be me. Good work, as always!!</td>', 'Sorry i didn''t get around to commenting on this during the challenge.  I did think it was a good photograph, but not the best you have done.  I like the coloring, it really seems to have some zip, and it adds interest.  I think the lace was a little indistinguishable, but the Levis part was good.  The composition seems a touch of balance to me.  It is too far right to be centered, and not enough space on the left to feel like it is on a solid third.  But that may just be me. Good work, as always!!', '2003-07-30 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
