(1002250, 29988, 10084, '<td valign="top">I think a more sepia color who make the feeling of the composition better. Currently is a bit too yellow. Glad you were able to include a nice shadow on the side. This helps to give you a feeling of the shiny surface of the metal on the vehicle.</td>', 'I think a more sepia color who make the feeling of the composition better. Currently is a bit too yellow. Glad you were able to include a nice shadow on the side. This helps to give you a feeling of the shiny surface of the metal on the vehicle.', '2004-11-09 23:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
